11:["$","h2",null,{"children":"1. Segmentasi Jaringan Kritis (Micro-Segmentation)"}]
12:["$","p",null,{"children":["Jaringan datar (",["$","em",null,{"children":"flat network"}],") merupakan risiko terbesar di lingkungan rumah sakit. Pisahkan infrastruktur jaringan ke dalam zona VLAN terisolasi menggunakan aturan ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Access Control List (ACL)"}]," pada firewall dan ",["$","em",null,{"children":"core switch"}],":"]}]
13:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zona Server Inti (Core Data Center)"}],": Menampung server aplikasi SIMRS, database rekam medis, server PACS/DICOM radiologi, serta ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Active Directory / Identity Provider"}],". Hanya port aplikasi spesifik dari ",["$","em",null,{"children":"reverse proxy"}]," atau ",["$","em",null,{"children":"application tier"}]," yang diizinkan masuk."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zona Perangkat Medis (IoMT)"}],": Alat diagnostik laboratorium dan radiologi sering kali berjalan di atas sistem operasi ",["$","em",null,{"children":"legacy"}]," yang tidak dapat sembarangan di-patch. Isolasi perangkat ini dalam VLAN khusus dengan pembatasan akses keluar (",["$","em",null,{"children":"egress filtering"}],")."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zona Workstation Staf & Publik"}],": Komputer poliklinik, administrasi, dan jaringan Wi-Fi pengunjung wajib dipisahkan total sehingga kompromi pada satu PC staf tidak merambat ke server database utama."]}],"\n"]}]
14:["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. Strategi Backup 3-2-1-1-0 Anti-Ransomware"}]
15:["$","p",null,{"children":["Ketika serangan ",["$","em",null,{"children":"ransomware"}]," menargetkan enkripsi sistem penyimpanan utama, ",["$","em",null,{"children":"backup"}]," menjadi lini pertahanan terakhir untuk menjaga kontinuitas pelayanan rumah sakit:"]}]
16:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"3"}]," salinan data (1 data produksi + 2 salinan cadangan)."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"2"}]," media penyimpanan yang berbeda."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"1"}]," salinan disimpan di lokasi terpisah (",["$","em",null,{"children":"off-site"}],")."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"1"}]," salinan bersifat ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Immutable"}]," (",["$","em",null,{"children":"Write-Once-Read-Many"}],") atau ",["$","em",null,{"children":"air-gapped"}]," sehingga tidak dapat dihapus maupun dienkripsi bahkan oleh akun administrator yang terkompromi."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"0"}]," error pada hasil verifikasi pemulihan (",["$","em",null,{"children":"automated restore drill"}],") berkala."]}],"\n"]}]
17:["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. High Availability & Observability Real-Time"}]
18:["$","p",null,{"children":["Ketersediaan (",["$","em",null,{"children":"Availability"}],") dalam segitiga ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"CIA Triad"}]," berdampak langsung pada keselamatan pasien:"]}]
19:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Virtualisasi & Klasterisasi"}],": Manfaatkan klaster virtualisasi (",["$","strong",null,{"children":"VMware"}],") dan kontainerisasi (",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Docker"}],") untuk meminimalkan ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Single Point of Failure (SPOF)"}]," pada layanan kritis seperti pendaftaran IGD dan farmasi."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Observability Server & Database"}],": Pantau metrik utilisasi CPU, memori, latensi kueri database, dan kapasitas penyimpanan secara real-time menggunakan ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Grafana"}]," agar potensi gangguan terdeteksi sebelum memengaruhi operasional pelayanan."]}],"\n"]}]
1a:["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Kontrol Akses Berbasis Peran (RBAC) & Audit Trail"}]
1b:["$","p",null,{"children":["Terapkan prinsip ",["$","em",null,{"children":"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)"}]," yang ketat di dalam aplikasi SIMRS maupun akses infrastruktur server. Pastikan setiap aktivitas pembacaan, perubahan, dan penghapusan data rekam medis tercatat dalam ",["$","em",null,{"children":"audit log"}]," yang dikirim ke server ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"SIEM"}]," terpusat untuk memenuhi standar kepatuhan perlindungan data pribadi."]}]
